.SH "NAME"
roark\-benchmark\-target\-score\-sample\-list \- List score samples for a target
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.B roark benchmark target score\-sample list
\fItarget\-key\fR [\fIoptions\fR]
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Returns the individual scored calls behind a target’s aggregate cells, each with the scorer’s rationale — the "why is this number what it is" read. Filter to one cell with `conditionKey` and `metricKey`. Metrics computed without a rationale (latencies, counts) contribute no samples. Returns reasoning only: no transcript and no audio.
.SH "API"
GET /v1/benchmark/target/{targetKey}/score\-sample
